      "text": "images … Laban searched all the tent, but found them not, Gen. 31:34. to search out a resting place, Num. 10:33. Send thou men, that they may search the land, Num. 13:2. Lord searcheth all hearts, 1 Chr. 28:9 (Jer. 17:10). cause which I knew not I searched out, Job 29:16. my spirit made diligent search, Ps. 77:6. Search me, O God, and know my heart, Ps. 139:23. spirit of man … searching all the inward parts, Prov. 20:27. I gave my heart to … search out … all things, Eccl. 1:13. no searching of his understanding, Isa. 40:28. ye shall … find me, when ye shall search for me, Jer. 29:13. Let us search and try our ways, Lam. 3:40. I, will both search my sheep, and seek them out, Ezek. 34:11.",
